# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CC1 Vision - .gitignore
#
# The trained model models/stain_classifier.keras is deliberately NOT ignored.
# At 5.6 MB it is well inside GitHub's limits and it is what makes the
# repository runnable straight after cloning, with no training step.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.Python

# --- Virtual environments --------------------------------------------------
.venv/
.venv-*/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# --- Testing and tooling caches --------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Editors and IDEs ------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Logs and temporary files ----------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
tmp/
temp/

# --- Streamlit -------------------------------------------------------------
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# --- CC1 Vision: generated training dataset --------------------------------
# ~14 MB across 6,500 image files. Fully reproducible in about a minute with
#   python dataset_generator.py
# so it is regenerated rather than versioned.
dataset/

# --- CC1 Vision: generated analysis output ---------------------------------
# Every saved run writes a PNG + JSON + CSV bundle here. Output, not source.
reports/*
!reports/.gitkeep

# --- CC1 Vision: redundant archive of this same project --------------------
cc1_vision.zip

# --- CC1 Vision: KEEP the trained model ------------------------------------
# models/ is tracked, including the .keras weights and their metadata:
#   stain_classifier.keras, labels.json, model_config.json,
#   metrics.json, training_history.json
# Nothing under models/ is ignored.

# --- OS-specific -----------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
